    "description": "H=3, K=3 (27 leaves) stress-test environment: a SINGLE leaf (arm_000) undergoes a dramatic MIXED-SIGN parameter flip at an asymmetric switch point rel_t=0.4 (theta [-1.4, -0.4, 1.1, 0.0] -> [1.4, 0.4, -1.1, -0.0]); all other 26 leaves stay neutral (theta=0) throughout. The mixed-sign design ensures whether arm_000 beats a neutral leaf genuinely depends on which job archetype appears (favors large-n jobs, penalizes large-m jobs) rather than being a context-independent scalar fact -- this specifically prevents a context-free policy from solving the environment as well as a context-aware one. Reuses the same 4 job archetypes and Sigma as the H-family physical environments."
